{
  "format": 2,
  "id": "xyz-gantry",
  "version": 1,
  "name": "XYZ gantry",
  "description": "A portal on four columns: a bridge travels along its length, a carriage across the bridge, and a mast with a suction frame up and down in the carriage. Each axis drives to one of its taught positions, chosen by number in binary, when its go signal comes on, and says when it is there. Its vacuum switch says when the frame holds a carton. Two I/O blocks on its front beam take its signals to the PLC.",
